"恢复物理输出会绕过软件衰减。请先暂停播放并降低外部音箱音量。只恢复仍由本模式占用的输出，保留你后来更改的设备选择。" = "Restoring physical outputs bypasses software attenuation. Pause playback and lower your external speaker volume first. Only routes still owned by this mode are restored; later device choices are preserved.";
