"需要单独安装 Ez Software Audio 1.0.0（协议 1），原版 Proxy Audio Device 不兼容。应用不会自动安装或请求录音许可。仅支持双声道 Float32 物理输出；其他虚拟、聚合和多声道设备不可作目标。首次启用为 0% 且静音；主动调高音量才发声。退出、休眠或失联后保持静音，不自动恢复物理输出。驱动或系统音频服务崩溃时，macOS 仍可能直接回退硬件输出，无法保证无旁路音频。安装、卸载、恢复前须暂停播放并降低音箱音量。只控制这台 Mac 经过虚拟输出的音频，不控制光纤切换器的其他来源。" = "Ez Software Audio 1.0.0 (protocol 1) requires a separate installation; the original Proxy Audio Device is incompatible. This app never installs it automatically or requests recording permission. Only stereo Float32 physical destinations are supported, excluding virtual, aggregate, and multichannel devices. Activation starts at 0% and muted; increase volume explicitly to hear audio. Quit, sleep, or lost contact leaves the software path muted without restoring physical outputs. If the driver or system audio service crashes, macOS may fall back directly to hardware: bypass audio cannot be ruled out. Pause playback and lower speaker volume before installation, removal, or restoration. This controls only this Mac’s audio routed through the virtual device, not other sources on an optical switch.";

"软件模式需要音频输入许可；请先使用单独的授权入口，再明确启用" = "Software mode requires audio input permission. Use the separate permission action, then explicitly enable it.";

