"软件模式从虚拟设备接收这台 Mac 的音频，再输出到指定硬件。macOS 可能将其列为麦克风权限；不读取物理麦克风，不保存录音。许可只在你点击请求后申请，完成后仍须单独启用软件模式。" = "Software mode receives this Mac’s audio from a virtual device and forwards it to your selected hardware. macOS may list this as microphone permission. It does not read a physical microphone or save recordings. Permission is requested only after your click; you must enable software mode separately afterward.";

