"请在系统设置的麦克风权限中检查 Ez Audio Control；软件模式保持关闭" = "Check Ez Audio Control under Microphone in System Settings. Software mode remains off.";

"需要单独安装 Ez Software Audio 2.0.0（协议 2）。旧 1.0.0 组件不可安装。插件仅提供虚拟回环，实际硬件由 App 内客户端输出，无辅助进程或后台服务。仅支持 48 kHz、交错 Float32 双声道及不超过 1024 帧的设备缓冲。首次启用为 0% 且静音；主动调高音量才发声。音频输入权限须单独明确申请，完成后不自动接管。退出、休眠或失联后保持静音；恢复输出前须暂停播放并降低音箱音量。系统音频服务崩溃时 macOS 仍可能回退硬件，不能保证无旁路音频。只控制这台 Mac 经过虚拟输出的音频。" = "Requires a separate Ez Software Audio 2.0.0 installation (protocol 2). Do not install the old 1.0.0 component. The plug-in provides virtual loopback; an in-app client outputs to hardware, with no helper or background service. Supports only 48 kHz interleaved Float32 stereo and device buffers up to 1024 frames. Initial volume is 0% and muted. Audio input permission requires a separate explicit request and never enables routing automatically. Quit, sleep, or lost connection mutes the path. Pause playback and lower speaker volume before restoring output. An audio service crash may cause macOS to fall back to hardware; bypass audio cannot be ruled out. Only this Mac’s audio routed through the virtual output is controlled.";

