"纯软件衰减" = "Software attenuation";

"当前输出没有可用的音量控制；纯软件衰减尚待验收" = "No volume control is available for this output; software attenuation awaits validation.";

"软件衰减 %@，100% 原始电平，0% 静音" = "Software attenuation %@; 100% original level, 0% silence";

"软件衰减；100% 原始电平，0% 静音" = "Software attenuation; 100% original level, 0% silence";

"100% 表示进入软件处理的原始音频，0% 表示静音；只向下衰减，不读取硬件百分比作为基准，也不写硬件音量。音量变化经过约 5 毫秒平滑过渡，随后 0% 精确为零。此候选使用 Apple 音频 tap 原型，无需独立 HAL 驱动；尚未通过真实链路验收，启用入口已禁用，不会申请系统音频捕获权限。仅规划接管当前输出的一个 PCM 流；其它设备、受保护内容、独占或绕过路径不作保证。退出或崩溃后原始音频可能恢复，软件电平不等于实际声压。" = "100% is the original audio entering software processing; 0% is silence. Gain only attenuates and never uses a hardware percentage as calibration or writes hardware volume. Changes ramp over about 5 ms, after which 0% is exactly zero. This Apple audio tap prototype needs no separate HAL driver. Live validation is pending, so activation is disabled and no system audio capture permission will be requested. The planned scope is one PCM stream on the current output. Other devices, protected content, exclusive output and bypass paths are not guaranteed. Original audio may resume on exit or crash. Signal level is not sound pressure.";
"尚待真实音频验收 · 此候选不可启用" = "Live audio validation pending · Unavailable in this candidate";

"请先确认本次系统音频处理与安全播放范围" = "Confirm this session’s system audio processing and safe playback conditions first.";

"此系统或当前输出不支持软件衰减" = "Software attenuation is unavailable on this system or output.";

"软件音频启动或运行失败（阶段 %@，状态 %@）；请暂停播放后退出软件模式" = "Software audio failed (stage %@, status %@). Detect audio devices again or restart the App.";

"系统不可调时自动启用 · 沿用参考音量" = "Automatic when system volume is unavailable · Uses reference level";

"请先退出其它 Ez Audio Control 实例，再启用软件衰减" = "Quit other Ez Audio Control instances before enabling software attenuation.";

"启用本次软件衰减" = "Enable software attenuation for this session";

"将处理当前输出 %@ 的系统音频。macOS 可能请求系统音频录制权限；不读取物理麦克风，不保存音频。请先暂停所有播放，确认外部音箱已处于安全音量。继续后原流会被静音，软件增益从 0% 开始；退出或崩溃后原始音频可能恢复。只有选择继续才会创建音频 tap。" = "This will process system audio on the current output, %@. macOS may request system audio recording permission. No physical microphone is opened and no audio is saved. Pause all playback and confirm a safe external speaker level first. Continuing mutes the original stream and starts software gain at 0%. Original audio may resume on exit or crash. An audio tap is created only after you choose to continue.";

"已暂停，允许本次处理" = "Playback paused; allow this session";

"正在准备系统音频处理" = "Preparing system audio processing";

"等待有效音频帧" = "Waiting for valid audio frames";

"未知" = "Unknown";

"100% 表示进入处理的原始 PCM，0% 在约 5 毫秒平滑过渡后精确静音；不会标定或改变硬件音量。无需独立 HAL 驱动。当前输出没有系统音量控制时自动启用，手动启用也无需二次确认；首次系统音频许可仍由 macOS 决定。只有收到有效音频帧后才能调节。当前设备的真实听感尚待验收；其它设备、受保护内容、独占或绕过路径不作保证。退出或崩溃后原始音频可能恢复，PCM 电平不等于实际声压。" = "100% is the original incoming PCM. 0% is exact silence after a smooth transition of about 5 ms. Hardware volume is never calibrated or changed. No separate HAL driver is needed. Starts automatically when the current output has no system volume control. Manual activation needs no second confirmation; macOS still controls the initial system audio permission. Adjustment becomes available only after valid audio frames arrive. Listening tests on the actual device are still pending. Other devices, protected content, exclusive output and bypass paths are not guaranteed. Original audio may resume on exit or crash. PCM level is not sound pressure.";

